{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "55ad5d94352f96790f26aa334fc4aa2fb1d5b4293d13fb5cbc7fb4e227320fd9", "ja": "幸せを願う想い", "zh": "祈愿幸福的心意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c613d701c6a9a86884203338d510b15971712c0c55ac813d10a6bc17141edf5f", "ja": "プロデューサーに呼ばれ、アンケート回答に\n悩んでいる事を話す響と奈緒。結婚に不安を\n感じている人に寄り添いたいという2人に、\nそれはもう2人なりのやり方でできていると\nプロデューサーは答える。", "zh": "被制作人叫来后，响和奈绪谈起了自己为问卷回答而烦恼的事。制作人回答说，想要陪伴那些对结婚感到不安的人的2人，已经在用属于2人的方式做到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8a7bec71dab7a5bf1f6b0e7fb433abf218c5c4953dfa00604b76de5b6e4803c0", "ja": "（アンケートも出そろってきた。〆切まで\nあと少しだが、未提出者があとふたり……）", "zh": "（问卷也陆陆续续收齐了。离截止日期只剩一点时间，可还剩两个人没提交……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "42142740d131dc574a0e925474c29d0aac5c3ce707ae0f36203bf96e24c5d85e", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n自分たちが呼ばれたってことは……。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n既然把我们叫来，也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "372b1736d6bbe2c0a3714c5d0072db9fb8f415b0673a928a404c950278e8ff8e", "ja": "まあ、お察しの通りだ。例のアンケート、\nだいぶ悩んでるみたいだと思って。", "zh": "嗯，正如你猜的那样。看起来她似乎一直为那份问卷的事烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "ba7c63a994db3e99a0e73ec7bc57ac63aeb071f958c0bca7f04772e5878dff8d", "ja": "さ、さすが{$P$}さん、\n見破ってきますね……。", "zh": "不、不愧是{$P$}先生，一下子就看穿了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fd3fa649614b59deacfa816e4c748a08ee524718d3e51cab241b6acb3fa0ba38", "ja": "こんな時のためのプロデューサーだからな。\n悩みがあるなら、力になるぞ！", "zh": "正因为是这种时候才需要制作人啊。有烦恼的话，我会帮你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "f8db43fe5b3723d6e07f613b6940231394d5ca356f7fae20d72955d7d14f951c", "ja": "〆切もありますもんね……。\n実は……私と響、同じ質問で悩んでて……。", "zh": "毕竟也有截止日期在呢……\n其实……我和响，都在为同一个问题烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "25cd123ad4ac1fc5c2d9c29bf10cb7606f91f283172608f668ae4ec6f4bbaf40", "ja": "アンケート、99個目の質問『Q.結婚に関する不安、\nなんでも書いてみて！』ってあるでしょ？", "zh": "问卷里的第99个问题“Q.关于结婚的烦恼，什么都可以写下来！”你看到了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2a7c7ef0b53f4382acab1112afa9a20ab2ac14095fcbeb91692dffad41f8381e", "ja": "結婚に関する不安か……。\nまあ、実際にするとなったら色々あるだろうなぁ。", "zh": "对结婚的担忧吗……。真要结婚的话，实际来说应该会遇到各种各样的问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "7e476ee6f1baa0d98d4ccb752f9a0416246918f06a04d847d44df28566e21cad", "ja": "そう、そうなんだ！　やっぱりみんな、\n真剣に悩んでるのが資料から分かるから！", "zh": "对，对啊！果然从资料里就能看出来，大家都在认真烦恼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9d6841aefa4ab851d48a76968fb479eb298a77a488872bf56407fefab6870180", "ja": "資料……アンケートについてる参考資料か。\n式場で挙式した人達の感想がまとまっている……。", "zh": "资料……是问卷附带的参考资料吗？里面整理了在婚礼场地举行婚礼的人们的感想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "6da224add2330f4ccaae86310520429df5eb21d6c5bc232c6c86e5d83ff0ace3", "ja": "うん。「地元が違うって、結構大変！」って。\n「日常の文化の差が何気にストレス」とか……。", "zh": "嗯。上面写着“老家不同，真的挺辛苦的！”之类的话。\n还有“日常文化上的差异，不知不觉间会让人感到压力”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "190df38e8f4a9a9021dcad886fbae0e43802f39943405a103293a828ed000716", "ja": "「食文化の差をなめてた」「地元が遠い同士、\n誰にも頼れなくてつらい！」とかもあったなぁ。", "zh": "“小看了饮食文化的差异”“同为老家离得远的人，\n谁也依靠不上好难受！”之类的也有呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "cc81ad9cddbdc5b3e3cff9a21887b34c75a05d53ea734b9bcd7a40ec7ecd6aca", "ja": "ほら、今回の5人の中だと、\n上京組って自分と奈緒だけだから。", "zh": "你看，这次这5人里，从外地来东京的就只有我和奈绪嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "2301b850cfc2ab7a02ddca1bbc787c840b197d859c053dc3569b56386e9ff5be", "ja": "なんや、上手に答えられへんていうか……。\nそこでだいぶ悩んでもうて……。", "zh": "总觉得……不是说没法好好回答……\n就是为这事儿烦恼了好久……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a3fc3a5474a60263644d4cdece2f4807d4d8e724e1dc8b0a346850055f8bf7ee", "ja": "なるほど。同じ地方出身の人達に共感して、\n悩んでいたというわけか……。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，你是因为对同乡产生了共鸣，所以才一直烦恼吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "cdcee09a8ae9436cc7d2afb24e9624fd32f6cac9afa2c9b17370513d1824fb8e", "ja": "うん。結婚って、地元も好みも、いろいろ違う人と\n家族になるってことでしょ？", "zh": "嗯。结婚就是要和来自不同地方、喜好也各不相同的人组建家庭，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "79455f3b4522f38d325756aafe9243446b61c79cd937f157859d2ad36bee0882", "ja": "結婚したら終わりやなくて、始まりやからなぁ。\n私の関西風を、相手とすり合わせていかんと……。", "zh": "结婚并不是结束，而是开始嘛。今后也得和对方互相协调，找到适合我的关西风格才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "4eb70e43f38c1f2d0a7eed8252e4906c13ae4159e34519e90b1043c797b13dd4", "ja": "自分もね、家族……ハム蔵とかいぬ美と一緒に\n暮らしてて、大変なこともあるから。", "zh": "我也是呢，和家人……哈姆藏还有犬美一起生活，也会有辛苦的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "4d7652c98376c1ba52d6be5a14a7fae49e745193383986bae907225214266cde", "ja": "だからこの回答を、想像で何か\n書いちゃうのは、違う気がするっていうか……。", "zh": "所以，我总觉得凭想象写下什么来回答，似乎不太对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "381746e43cc99fc40b82ef125e785caf38c8bf315031fae3066aa4d5542267c1", "ja": "うまく言えないけど、こういう不安に\n寄り添ってあげたいんだ！", "zh": "虽然不太说得清楚，但我希望能去贴近并分担这份不安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1175c5e23f2d68063fa0446daa13290ac77a7a98fd2f834d6ecad47aa87d67a4", "ja": "不安に寄り添う……。\n確かに、それは大事かもしれないな。", "zh": "陪伴这份不安……  \n确实，这或许很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "49844a98160d769b1fc6e18d9734018bfc69322284f3fe63db3bb07e3b137d55", "ja": "やっぱり、\n{$P$}もそう思うよね？", "zh": "果然，\n{$P$}也这么觉得对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bcdc6980734fedf7a87573c3f4b86083daf9c5b9b8e71130632b9e770641581f", "ja": "ああ。だからこそ、ふたりの想像力で、\n気持ちを伝えてあげるべきだと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。正因为如此，我觉得应该用我们两个人的想象力，把这份心意传达给她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "718394d027118b188917312558dcddaeebacfe65454c051c7624a295010b2065", "ja": "想像力で、ですか……？", "zh": "用想象力吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "53e86817d69590bbe4cfbb79b297275b4e3b57dc2f38e9a0b2de982f1dcd2436", "ja": "ふたりは、俺に手料理を振る舞ってくれただろ？\n地元の料理に、アレンジまでしてくれて。", "zh": "两个人不是给我做过亲手料理吗？\n还在当地料理的基础上进行了改良。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f3eb595de64f89ffac2ad89924462467facd202245384299b0ab0ae065ccb63d", "ja": "代理ではあるけど、俺の生活や健康を想像して作って\nくれたんだろう？　あれも立派な想像力じゃないか。", "zh": "虽说是代人做的，但也是设想着我的生活和健康状况做出来的吧？那不也是很了不起的想象力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "bdd5f15fabbdcf1418b7a81e4bc2a5064f517e14f51ca076fbbfea98282ae421", "ja": "ふたりはとっくに、自分なりの方法で、\n相手とどうしていくかを想像できてると思うんだ。", "zh": "我觉得，你们两个人早就已经用自己的方式，想象过今后要如何和对方相处了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "4db85e55b19a0c626e60b48736abeb46c1d8469aa84e6101d74c8ec08a55942a", "ja": "あの時は……。あんまりに不健康そうだったから、\n意地でも栄養摂らせないとって思って……。", "zh": "那时候……因为看起来实在太不健康了，\n就觉得无论如何都得给补充营养才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "283ebda90ba261e7f62920de80aee500f11e80f369e65cd7cca8835e9d9bc15a", "ja": "机の上の栄養ドリンクあんだけ見てたら、\nそう思うのも当然って話やな！", "zh": "光盯着桌上那堆营养饮料看，会这么想也是理所当然的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "6369e8867d8e7e854575ea237312df652120db97e74261466373a184944e64e6", "ja": "ふ、不摂生で申し訳ない……。でも、本当の結婚も\nそれの延長線上のことだと思うんだ。", "zh": "对不起，我的生活实在太不规律了……不过，我觉得真正的婚姻也是在此基础上延伸出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5be8e830ae4504c53ae3420aeff03473982dfd1e3d149dc0573390395b1d7814", "ja": "相手が大変そうだったり、悲しんでたり、悩んでたり、\nそんな時に何ができるか想像をする事……。", "zh": "想象对方是否正辛苦、悲伤或烦恼，在那种时候自己能做些什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "7a7058bae8afc491f6bd4e4e5d46b977fae202b526752544c40a5848fb10c2d1", "ja": "きっと結婚生活って長いはずだろう？\nそういう想像力は必要になるだろうから。", "zh": "婚姻生活一定会很长吧？\n所以，这种想象力是必不可少的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1035_037nao", "source_sha256": "81e03420aabda6db939ad85e37b6c71511bf42e7311198bc9d76f4fa5550d7a1", "ja": "わかりました！　ほんなら私は、アンケートに\n地元の料理のレシピも書いとこうと思います！", "zh": "我明白了！那我打算在问卷里，\n把老家菜肴的菜谱也写上去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "e9bec16a660d0658df9f925caa9d91feeb15217f926e5826492b3cc72cd5a319", "ja": "関西の人はこんなん食べるんやってことが、\n誰かの役に立つかもしれへんし……。", "zh": "让别人知道关西人都吃这些，说不定能帮上谁的忙呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "3c3e8af9d7c16a7ad8def156615ca6b8d2ad72f303929257c69e019ba62fed3f", "ja": "いいアイディアだね！　自分も、みんなの不安を\n吹き飛ばせるよう、たくさん書いておくさー！", "zh": "这个主意真不错！我也得多写一些，\n把大家的担忧全都吹跑啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "e6ba62ba5731299686a5e3a2581b0dbd87b3406a1c6b97b6e174ebe8e0dc9eb0", "ja": "うん、いいんじゃないかな。\nこれで回答はまとまりそうかな？", "zh": "嗯，挺不错的。\n这样一来，回答就能整理妥当了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "c4a87cd2f2d9e13ba7532f6f910ee5b4eb468e0f90936aa9b80da69dc7cba494", "ja": "うん、ありがとう！\n{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你！\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "19ec5b40ef58da5c7599a8601e9dc1b14234373b2c3dd62443f7cb05330fd5b3", "ja": "結婚って、ほんまに大変なんですね……。\nいろんな人の悩みや不安を読んで、わかりました。", "zh": "结婚真的很不容易呢……。读了大家的各种烦恼和不安之后，我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "045aaee5a5069a859a5036cafdf6a942a1c1c3bba366d8aa0f37ab968f68c169", "ja": "そうだな。アンケートに書かれている事なんて、\nほんの一部だろうし……。", "zh": "是啊。问卷里写的那些事，恐怕也只是其中一小部分吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "f03239cbac48bfdb0e9167a221eeeabe5014d458a36bd52fdabe4a51082da4a0", "ja": "でも、それでも相手と一緒にいたい、何かして\nあげたいと思えたからこそ、結婚なんだろうな。", "zh": "不过，正因为即便如此，还是想和对方在一起，想为对方做些什么，所以才会结婚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "9e3b9af10495c4c6973b11286174b5019d4359392648435391b20c00c59182a3", "ja": "そういう相手と出会えるのは、\n本当にすごいことだなぁ……。", "zh": "能遇到那样的对象，真的是一件非常了不起的事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1044_013hib", "source_sha256": "fc60e26b749b26357eb2a588ea269445ebdb9e465cdd826fcfa1f069379594d6", "ja": "うん。\nきっと、奇跡のはずだよね……。", "zh": "嗯。\n那一定算是奇迹了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1045_037nao", "source_sha256": "0083fc55f31b22925aa03ac2afcb4175b8d114ef5b01b05d350f31c900e6d68b", "ja": "それって、ほんまにすごいことやんな。\nめっちゃパワーがある気ぃするわ。", "zh": "那真的很厉害，对吧。\n感觉里面蕴含着特别强大的力量呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1046_037nao", "source_sha256": "f5e0ed9d047746e5d6bab077b7697a8c2c9033b7aa7bfe4e911d0515af3e4338", "ja": "大変やけど、大変なことばっかりやないって。\n結婚する人たちも、忘れんでくれたらええなぁ……。", "zh": "虽然辛苦，但也绝非只有辛苦的事。\n希望那些结婚的人，也别忘了这一点呀……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "dd384e54c70f902abd34ebd37648594a2c84963c50b597d01247528371380201", "ja": "（結婚に関するあれこれが変わる昨今、\n正解というものはないかもしれない。だけど……）", "zh": "（如今，和结婚有关的种种事情都在发生变化，或许根本不存在所谓的正确答案。但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "6a763b53df6523032ccc72d5502930e79b955eedc2e297e718def8bf9242758c", "ja": "（結ばれる人たちの幸せを祈る気持ちは本物だ。\n響と奈緒の気持ちも、届くといいな……）", "zh": "（祈愿结为连理的人们幸福的心意是真切的。希望响和奈绪的心意也能传达到啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
